{"availability":"available","full":"thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent","name":"Jarvis-OS-Agent","description":"An open-source autonomous AI OS Agent for Windows. Features zero line-drift coding, lifelong memory, Android ADB control, and proactive HITL.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":10,"forks":3,"created":"2026-03-25T18:28:02Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:02:34Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jarvis-os-agent.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-agent","android-control","automation-tool","autonomous-agents","chromadb","code-editor","developer-tools","gemini-api","groq","llm","open-source","personal-assistant","python","voice-assistant","whatsapp-automation","windows-automation"],"demo":"https://jarvis-os-agent.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.703Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.703Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.703Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.703Z","stars":10,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI Operating System that autonomously controls your PC, Android phone, local files, and lifelong memory — not just your code.","[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) []( []( [](","Most AI coding assistants stop at generating code. Most desktop assistants stop at opening apps. Jarvis is built on a different premise: an assistant should be able to see, act, remember, correct itself mid-task, and reach out — across your PC, your phone, and your communication channels — with one continuous mind."],"features":["It acts in the real world, not just in chat. Gmail, WhatsApp, Telegram, Google Calendar, Termux on your Android, file system, terminal, GUI mouse and keyboard — all native tools the agent chooses from autonomously.","It remembers for months, not minutes. A weighted property-graph memory layer with temporal decay, plus hybrid BM25 and vector RAG for your workspace do